    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>types</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a> used to initialize the <a href=\"ManagedTypes.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>ManagedTypes</code></a>; must not be\n         null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>new instance of <a href=\"ManagedTypes.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>ManagedTypes</code></a> initialized the given, required <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a>.</dd>\n<dt>See Also:</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list\">\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#fromStream(java.util.stream.Stream)\"><code>fromStream(Stream)</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#fromSupplier(java.util.function.Supplier)\"><code>fromSupplier(Supplier)</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
